["Prepare an explanation of the demo account's profit and loss report for the owner — in plain words, 4–5 sentences.","For example: \"Revenue for the period is 1.4 million. But cost shows 118 million because of an error in the fries recipe. Also, cash collection got into expenses. If we fix the recipe and categories, the report will show the real picture.\""]
